  m_text: "Look what we have here ... Not a Knight, for sure\u2026 and yet, here
    you are\u2026\r\nGo on, try your luck\u2026 I suppose you can take this relic,
    I have no use for it... not anymore\u2026 \r\nThere's these crystals aggloremations...
    they call it liminals... use it there to travel between realms...\r\nMaybe you'll
    get a few steps from me, eh..."
